  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Mental Mutation</strong></p><p>The corruption of your mind has broken the leash of time on you. You flicker in and out o the time continuum, making you appear slightly slower or faster. It looks truly disturbing. Your temporal instability also gives you a special ability. You can, with a successful <strong>Challenging (+0) Willpower</strong> Test, plunge forward into the river of time. You gain an additional Movement and Action in your Turn. Roll 1d10; on a 10 you age a full year due to your temporal tinkering. You suffer a @Table[majormis]{Major Miscast} if you Fumble your Willpower Test.</p>"
    },
